            "review_title": "Review at KAKI no KI",
            "review_text": "Rob P\n24 contributions\n0\nA shocker\nJul 2020\nI and my partner arrived at 7. 15pm for dinner. There were another couple and a table of 3 there that was all. We ordered meatballs and a pizza. After 40 minutes the meatballs, 6 small ones in a small bowl covered by what looked like tined crushed tomatoes arrived, microwaved not cooked. We waited another 50 minutes then I enquired where our pizza was, I was told 10 minutes, after 15 minutes I enquired again and told 10 minutes. We then decided to leave as we had waited for 1 hour 50 minutes and were hungry. The owners/ managers were too busy behind the bar drinking with a patron, but then took offence a my enquiring. I asked for the not insignificant bill and we left. BUT, we walked home, about 5 minus away and soon had stomach problems and many visits to the toilet by both of us through the night. Go at your own risk!!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2020",
