            "review_title": "Review at KAKI no KI",
            "review_text": "DerHenni\nHaan, Germany797 contributions\n0\nGood but expensive\nOct 2019 • Couples\nWe had dinner here, with two drinks and two dishes. Drinks were good and reasonably priced, the food was good and tasty as well, but in comparison with other local restaurants and the serving size, it was too expensive. The service was outstandingly friendly and helpful. Unfortunately we were not asked if everything should be served at the same time, so one dish was ready early, while the other took some more time, so that one of us already finished, before the other got it's meal.\nAll in all the food and service were good, but the value could've been better.\nRead more\nWritten October 31, 2019",
